  "scope": "dGPU diagnostics (ANAL-238): openbook-pc-setup logs to logd; a root-domain dgpu-report at boot completion and on debug.openbook.dgpu_report; a volatile dgpu-ctl on|auto hold from debug.openbook.dgpu_pm; read access to /sys/power/suspend_stats for openbook_pc_setup. The G14 lab (ANAL-257): allow-listed actions from debug.openbook.lab behind persist.vendor.openbook.lab (set only by openbook_pc_setup): reports, nouveau and openbook_sleep_diag loads and unloads through init's fixed vendor_modprobe services, and RTC-woken suspends through /sys/power/state. No firmware setting (dgpu_disable, gpu_mux_mode) is written",
